10
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:33,246
this ties into this connectors topic each

11
00:00:33,246 --> 00:00:34,432
time you open it.

12
00:00:35,153 --> 00:00:37,670
And this can include charts, tables, lists,

13
00:00:38,199 --> 00:00:41,309
anything you want. It's an HTML page so it

14
00:00:41,341 --> 00:00:42,768
can basically contain

15
00:00:43,409 --> 00:00:46,327
anything. So the idea is to have a status

16
00:00:46,455 --> 00:00:49,886
board, an interactive and up-to-date board

17
00:00:50,238 --> 00:00:52,884
with new information. You want to have, you

18
00:00:52,948 --> 00:00:55,194
want to have a look at in Cowork.

19
00:00:55,932 --> 00:00:56,092
Now,

20
